# Keeps web/public/ in git even while it is empty.
#
# The Dockerfile copies this directory into the runtime image. Git does not
# track empty directories, so without this file the build context has no
# web/public and the image build fails with "/app/public: not found" - but
# only in CI, because the directory exists on a working copy that has ever
# run `next build`.
#
# Static files that must be served from the site root (verification files,
# favicon.ico for ancient clients) go here. App-level assets like icon.svg
# live in app/ instead.
